    "estimatedTimeNote": "cutting + rapids through the trapezoid, timed on a rapid model of 1200 mm/min XY / 600 mm/min Z at 150 mm/s² (config read 2026-10-07 + stopwatch 2026-10-08 (#281)) — a planning estimate, not a measured cycle time.",
